{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":23,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["关于泰尔的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是关于泰尔的预言：",{"text":"他施的船只哀号吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为从基提","poem":1},{"noteId":12},{"text":"传来消息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说泰尔已被毁灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"房屋和港口都荡然无存。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海边的居民，西顿","poem":1},{"noteId":13},{"text":"的商贾啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要静默无言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的商人飘洋过海，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从大水之上把西曷的粮食、尼罗河边的农产都运到泰尔。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"泰尔成为列国的商埠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西顿啊，你要羞愧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这海上的堡垒啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大海否认你，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我没有经历过产痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有生过孩子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也未曾养育过儿女。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人听见泰尔的消息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都感到伤痛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海边的居民啊，你们要去他施！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要哀号！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这就是你们历史悠久、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"充满欢乐的城吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的双脚曾带她到远方居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"泰尔曾是封王之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的商贾是王侯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的商人名闻天下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但她如今的遭遇是谁定的？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是万军之耶和华定的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为要摧毁因荣华而生的骄傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞辱世上的尊贵者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他施的人民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去你们的田地耕作吧，像在尼罗河沿岸一样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为海港已不复存在。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华向大海伸手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使列国震动。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂已下令毁灭迦南的堡垒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂说：“受欺压的处女西顿啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你再也不能欢乐了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起来，逃到基提吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只是在那里你也得不到安宁。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["看看迦勒底人所居之地，这个民族已不复存在！亚述人使它成为野兽出没之地。他们筑起围城的高台，摧毁它的宫殿，使它沦为废墟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"他施的船只都哀号吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们的堡垒已被摧毁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["到那日，泰尔必被遗忘七十年，正好一个王的寿数。七十年之后，泰尔必如妓女之歌所描述的："]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"“被遗忘的妓女啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿起琴，走遍全城。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要弹得美妙，多多唱歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好使人再记起你。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["七十年后，耶和华必眷顾泰尔。她必重操旧业，与天下万国交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["但她得到的利润和收入不会被积攒或储存起来，而是要被献给耶和华，用来供应那些事奉耶和华的人，使他们吃得饱足，穿得精美。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"“基提”就是现在的塞浦路斯。","reference":{"chapter":23,"verse":1}},{"noteId":13,"caller":"+","text":"先知在本预言中提到西顿，是因为泰尔和西顿都在同一地区，都属于腓尼基人。","reference":{"chapter":23,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}